{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Backrooms! This is an alternate universe parallel to the real world. You\u2019ve accidentally entered here, and now your only task is to leave!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains a large number of rooms. You need to navigate through various rooms to find the secret to leaving the Backrooms! In addition, the rooms contain numerous \u201centities,\u201d \u201cweapons,\u201d \u201cequipment,\u201d \u201citems,\u201d \u201csecrets,\u201d and more! Be careful of the \u201centities\u201d because they are very dangerous!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Weapon System:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect various weapon parts in the game and freely assemble them into unique weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzle Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game hides many secrets. Finding these secrets can lead you to the ultimate ending, enhance your survival abilities, or unlock secrets of other companions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes about 60 endings, but only leaving the Backrooms is the true ending!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690690?t=1746796750","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690690?t=1746796750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690690/9e24382910d29428f1d2fffbd60116c4b0b3ef87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746796750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690690/9e24382910d29428f1d2fffbd60116c4b0b3ef87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746796750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"In the game, the battle between players and monsters includes effects such as bleeding and dismemberment."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Backrooms! This is an alternate universe parallel to the real world. You\u2019ve accidentally entered here, and now your only task is to leave!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains a large number of rooms. You need to navigate through various rooms to find the secret to leaving the Backrooms! In addition, the rooms contain numerous \u201centities,\u201d \u201cweapons,\u201d \u201cequipment,\u201d \u201citems,\u201d \u201csecrets,\u201d and more! Be careful of the \u201centities\u201d because they are very dangerous!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Weapon System:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can collect various weapon parts in the game and freely assemble them into unique weapons!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzle Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game hides many secrets. Finding these secrets can lead you to the ultimate ending, enhance your survival abilities, or unlock secrets of other companions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes about 60 endings, but only leaving the Backrooms is the true ending!</p>","developers":["\u5f20\u4eae002","\u6797\u5f3a003"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690690/277eefa115373124bddf2b942a9a7fc4f5a926d5/header.jpg?t=1746796750","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Infinite Loop:Backrooms","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win10/win11<br><